# Cargo features for the nano-rs/vector image: only the components the single-tenant
# ClickHouse product (nanosiem clickhouse/*) ships or renders, plus the runtime pieces they
# need. Built with --no-default-features.
#
# Derived from `scan-components.py` run against nanosiem clickhouse/dev (see REBASE.md,
# "Component set"). The image's `vector list` must equal COMPONENTS exactly; the nano-image
# workflow's parity job checks it.
# One feature per line; `#` starts a comment. The Dockerfile joins the lines with commas.
#
# nano/v0.61 dropped, relative to nano/v0.59 (lake / hosted-only): codecs-parquet (Bronze
# parquet sink), sinks-aws_s3 (R2 raw handoff), sinks-opentelemetry + sources-prometheus_scrape
# (hosted ops metrics, NAN-4028), sources-http_client (hosted thin pullers, NAN-3489),
# sources-kubernetes_logs (hosted region log shipper), transforms-sample (tenant lane sampling),
# enrichment-tables-memory.

# --- runtime (the non-component part of upstream's target-<triple>-unknown-linux-gnu set) ---
# GraphQL API + health endpoint: [api] is enabled in config/vector/00-base.toml.
api
api-client
# Allocator, as upstream's Linux release targets.
tikv-jemallocator
# Full VRL standard library (crypto, env, network, system functions): parser VRL may use any
# stdlib function, and the platform VRL uses get_env_var and sha2.
vrl/stdlib
# GeoIP / MMDB enrichment tables (self-hosted geo/ASN enrichment in VRL). The `file` (CSV)
# table is always built in.
enrichment-tables-geoip
enrichment-tables-mmdb

# --- sources ---
# Push ingest (config/vector 00-base, 01-vector-source, 02-hec-source, 03-otlp-source).
sources-http_server
sources-opentelemetry
sources-splunk_hec
sources-vector
# Classic source generator (nanosiem-core source_configs: kafka, aws_s3 via SQS, gcp_pubsub)
# plus the Azure Event Hubs source this fork adds (NAN-3599). librdkafka is built from source
# with cmake, as upstream's Linux release targets do; SASL PLAIN / SCRAM over SASL_SSL need only
# OpenSSL, so GSSAPI (libsasl2) is not enabled.
sources-aws_s3
sources-aws_sqs
sources-azure_event_hubs
# CrowdStrike Falcon Data Replicator (SQS batch manifests -> S3), this fork's source (NAN-5005).
sources-crowdstrike_fdr
sources-gcp_pubsub
sources-kafka
rdkafka?/cmake_build
# Opt-in templates (config/vector/sources/{file,syslog,http}.toml.disabled).
sources-file
sources-syslog
# Self-observability (92-metrics.toml).
sources-internal_logs
sources-internal_metrics
# Test harnesses that run this image (verify-vector-generation-rollback.sh, parser tests).
sources-demo_logs
sources-stdin

# --- transforms ---
transforms-dedupe
transforms-filter
transforms-metric_to_log
transforms-remap
transforms-route
transforms-throttle
transforms-trace_to_log

# --- sinks ---
sinks-blackhole
sinks-clickhouse
sinks-console
# Opt-in forwarding template (90-sinks.toml.disabled).
sinks-http
# prometheus_exporter (92-metrics.toml); the feature also builds prometheus_remote_write.
sinks-prometheus
